elem-simd-math
==============

This crate is a Rust port of SLEEF's vector math kernels, expressed against the
stable-Rust SIMD abstraction of `fearless_simd` so that it builds on stable Rust
with runtime CPU feature detection.

It was translated from `burrbull/sleef-rs` revision `3671d46` (the v0.3.3
release), which is itself a Rust port of SLEEF. The algorithms, the polynomial
coefficients and the accuracy tiers all come from upstream; only the SIMD layer
differs.

